---
<div class="bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[3px] p-6">
	<h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-ink mb-4">The Controller</h3>
	<dl class="flex flex-col gap-4">
		<div>
			<dt class="eyebrow text-muted mb-1">Behavior</dt>
			<dd class="text-ink">
				Takes delegated work back at the first sign of a mistake, redoing it
				rather than coaching the fix.
			</dd>
		</div>
		<div>
			<dt class="eyebrow text-muted mb-1">Cue</dt>
			<dd class="text-ink">
				A direct report's deliverable comes back imperfect, less than 48 hours
				before it's due.
			</dd>
		</div>
		<div>
			<dt class="eyebrow text-muted mb-1">The Rep</dt>
			<dd class="text-ink">
				Name the one thing that's wrong. Ask them to fix it by end of day. Don't
				touch it yourself until they've had the chance.
			</dd>
		</div>
		<div>
			<dt class="eyebrow text-muted mb-1">Dispute</dt>
			<dd class="text-ink">"If I don't fix this myself, it'll be wrong, and it'll reflect on me."</dd>
		</div>
		<div>
			<dt class="eyebrow text-muted mb-1">Anchor</dt>
			<dd class="pull-quote text-ink">
				"Some things are up to us, and some are not up to us." — Epictetus
			</dd>
		</div>
		<div>
			<dt class="eyebrow text-muted mb-1">Measure</dt>
			<dd class="text-ink">"Gives me ownership over my work instead of taking it back."</dd>
		</div>
	</dl>
</div>
